      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/seakeenPH/status/2002423545411088680",
      "text": "🏃‍♂️🏀 𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐑𝐋𝐘𝐌𝐏𝐈𝐂𝐒 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟓 𝐗 𝐒𝐄𝐀𝐊𝐄𝐄𝐍 🔥\n\nTo our fellow SeaKeenjoys, Tum Moas, Enjoyers, and friends from our nameless fandom, thank you for your unwavering and heartfelt support for Sea and Keen. Whether you were cheering loud at Impact Arena or supporting from home through the livestream, your energy, love, and passion were felt. SeaKeen truly felt the fire within this fandom.\n\nNow it’s time for everyone to rest and recharge. You’ve given so much love and strength, and you deserve a good rest just as much. Thank you for being such a warm, powerful, and beautiful community. \n\n(pcr. @nn_tand) \n\nCHEER UP SEAKEEN NONGNOOONG\n#GMMTVStarlympics2025 \n♡ #sea_ta_lay | @sea_ta_lay\n♡ #keenkeno | @keenkeno",
